Raspberry Pi & One Pi~5 Model B 8 GB; Debian 13/aarch64; Python 3.13.5; ONNX Runtime 1.23.2 CPU FP32; four intra-op/one inter-op threads, spinning disabled, one OpenCV thread.\\
Detector cost input & The same 1475-frame 3840$\times$2160 file; batch 1, input 640, confidence 0.25, NMS IoU 0.65, maxDet 300. Jetson uses full-file passes; Pi uses the first 300 frames.\\
Tracking input & R04/R02: 750 frames each, 26/19 trajectories and 1188/1227 visible GT boxes. Quality includes all frames and empty GT/predictions; the cost workload concatenates both clips (1500 frames).\\
